==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɒksən|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|boxen}}, replacing earlier {{m|enm|bixen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|byxen||made of boxwood}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|box|en|id2=made of}}.

====Adjective====
{{en-adj}}

# Made of [[boxwood]].
# Resembling [[box]] (the wood).

===Etymology 2===
From {{af|en|box|gloss1=computer|id1=computer|-en|pos2=archaic plural suffix|id2=plural noun}}, by analogy with {{m|en|VAXen}}.<ref>{{cite-web|url=http://foldoc.org/boxen|title=boxen|work=FOLDOC}}</ref>

